@startuml Weapons
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Weapon and SeedWeapon
rectangle c [
|= Responsibilities |= Collaborators |
| Attack towards the cursor on a cooldown | Player |
| Damage and knock back geese (Weapon) | EnemyManager, Enemy, Effect |
| Throw seeds and manage ammo (SeedWeapon) | SeedProjectile, SeedPickup |
| Report swings and ammo for the HUD | GameScreen |
]
@enduml
